1
00:00:00,656 --> 00:00:02,576
LEONARD: What does that mean?
- Nothing.

2
00:00:02,741 --> 00:00:05,951
You seem to be implying a back channel
between me and Penny...

3
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,830
(Sheldon:)- ...where, obviously, none exists.
- No, I didn't.

4
00:00:08,998 --> 00:00:12,248
(Sheldon:)I just think you need to be careful
how you phrase things, sir.

5
00:00:14,795 --> 00:00:18,135
- What's going on with you?
- Well, I might ask you the same question.

6
00:00:18,299 --> 00:00:22,179
Why do you drag me into matters
which have nothing to do with me...

7
00:00:22,344 --> 00:00:26,184
(Sheldon:)...but exist between you and Penny,
a person to whom I barely speak?

8
00:00:34,023 --> 00:00:36,233
(Leonard:)What's wrong with your face?

9
00:00:36,609 --> 00:00:39,569
(Sheldon:)There's no reason
to bring my looks into this.

10
00:00:41,196 --> 00:00:43,366
(Sheldon:)- Good day, Leonard.
- What?

11
00:00:43,532 --> 00:00:45,822
(Sheldon:)I said, good day.

12
00:00:48,621 --> 00:00:50,501
(Leonard:)Good day?

13
00:00:52,207 --> 00:00:54,547
(Penny:)Also today we have
a fresh-caught Alaska salmon...

14
00:00:54,710 --> 00:00:57,020
(Penny:)...served with a teriyaki glaze
and sticky rice.

